cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Crystal Visualizer in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Crystal Visualizer"
abstract: "A browser-based viewer and editor for atomic structures: opens VASP POSCAR, XYZ and XDATCAR files, measures distances and angles, edits coordinates and cells, previews periodic images and exports structures, images and movies. Nothing to install."
authors:
